# Private key / certificate material -- no legitimate reason for any of
# these shapes to ever be a tracked file; a production-readiness audit
# found none committed today, but nothing previously stopped `git add .`
# from staging one by accident.
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*

# Screen recordings / scratch captures -- never a commit, but nothing
# previously stopped one from becoming one.
*.mp4
*.mov
